# The "Ask about David" chat calls Claude through Vercel AI Gateway.
# The site itself is hosted on Netlify; only the model calls go through Vercel.
#
# 1. In the Vercel dashboard open AI Gateway and add paid credits. On the free
#    tier the gateway refuses Claude models ("Free tier users do not have access
#    to this model"). Set a monthly budget there as well.
# 2. Under AI Gateway > API keys, create a key.
# 3. Production: add it in Netlify under Project configuration > Environment
#    variables as AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY (scope must include Functions), then redeploy.
# 4. Local development: copy this file to .env.local (ignored by git) and paste it.
#
# To check a deployment, open /api/chat in a browser: it reports whether the
# function is live and whether it can see a key (yes or no, never the key).
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Optional. Any gateway model ID works. The default is the low-cost Claude model.
# CHAT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5
